{"product_id":"life-death-and-vanilla-slices","title":"Life, Death and Vanilla Slices","description":"\u003cp\u003ePoor Jean Collins. She stepped out into the road without looking and now lies broken in hospital. But what distracted her? And why was she carrying a box of vanilla slices, the cream cakes she only ever bought for special occasions? Jean's daughter Anne travels back up north to find out. But her mind is on her teenage sons in London - boys on the brink of becoming not very nice men. What damage could they do in just a few days? (Quite a lot, probably.) Meanwhile there are secrets waiting for Anne and Jean, back at the old family home. Secrets that were buried a long time ago . . . Jenny Eclair is celebrated for her unflinching black humour and brilliantly sharp observations. In her extraordinary new novel, she has also created a compelling and heart-breaking family drama that feels as rich and honest as real life.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 153 x 245\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jenny Eclair\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781847444936\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45750690349209,"sku":"16RC-29781847444936","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d6b34dbf484_Life__Death_and_Vanilla_Slices._by_Jenny_Eclair_Jenny_Eclair.jpg?v=1758970675","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/life-death-and-vanilla-slices","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}